WEBVTT

00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:06.790
Episode 1

00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:06.790
SOS from Earth!!
Awaken, Space Battleship Yamato

00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:06.790
( Air date: Oct 6, 1974 )

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:29.400
Goodbye, Earth.{Saraba chikyuu yo}

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
A ship is taking off...{Tabidatsu fune wa}

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:37.000
...it's the space battleship...

00:00:37.450 --> 00:00:42.350
...Yamato.{Uchuu senkan yamato}

00:00:38.410 --> 00:00:42.580
Space Battleship

00:00:38.410 --> 00:00:42.580
<i>YAMATO</i>

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:50.210
It's about to take off to Iscandar,
carrying the fate of humanity.{Ucyuu no kanata Isckandar he unmei seoi ima tobitatsu}

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:56.600
We'll return for sure.{Kanarazu koko he kaette kuru to}

00:00:57.100 --> 00:01:05.400
Smile back at the people waving their hands.{te wo furu hito ni egao de kotae}

00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:12.200
Leaving the Galactic System and
taking a long journey to Iscandar.{Ginga wo hanare Iscandar he harubaru nozomu}

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:18.900
Space battleship Yamato!{Ucyuu senkan yamato}

00:01:38.610 --> 00:01:40.430
Objects detected on radar.
They're approaching.

00:01:41.650 --> 00:01:45.190
Bearing 3 o'clock,
distance 100,000 km.

00:01:45.190 --> 00:01:48.030
Velocity, 27 space knots.

00:01:49.140 --> 00:01:53.850
6 heavy battleships, 8 cruisers, and
many escorts are rapidly approaching.

00:02:42.720 --> 00:02:46.020
Enemy flagship identified.
Bearing 11.5 o'clock, distance 25000 km.

00:02:49.050 --> 00:02:51.380
All hands,
battle stations.

00:02:51.380 --> 00:02:54.350
Turn 30 degrees starboard,
prepare for a gun and torpedo battle.

00:03:04.470 --> 00:03:09.270
Message from the enemy ship.
"Earth fleet, surrender immediately.''

00:03:10.900 --> 00:03:11.960
How should we reply ?

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:14.690
Tell them, "Idiots.''

00:03:14.690 --> 00:03:15.570
Wha...?

00:03:17.280 --> 00:03:18.530
I said, "Idiots."

00:03:19.290 --> 00:03:22.600
This is Earth command
ship 225, "Idiots.''

00:03:22.600 --> 00:03:23.690
Over.

00:03:32.780 --> 00:03:36.280
Target, right +4.
Error correction 22.

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:52.200
Main gun,
correction zero degrees.

00:03:54.670 --> 00:03:55.800
Aim carefully.

00:03:59.790 --> 00:04:00.860
Fire !

00:04:15.280 --> 00:04:17.540
Damage to the stern !
Cyan gas being generated !

00:04:17.870 --> 00:04:19.590
Radar malfunctioning !

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:25.610
One of our assault
ships has exploded.

00:04:41.370 --> 00:04:44.070
We can't defeat them
with this kind of ship.

00:04:45.940 --> 00:04:47.740
Unidentified flying
object detected.

00:04:48.390 --> 00:04:50.990
It's much faster than
interplanetary cruise speed.

00:04:50.990 --> 00:04:53.690
At this rate, it'll reach Mars
orbit in a matter of minutes.

00:05:01.760 --> 00:05:06.440
Earth Defense Force Command Center

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:08.590
Unidentified flying object of unknown
origin is freefalling towards Mars' surface.

00:05:08.590 --> 00:05:09.840
It's going to crash.

00:05:09.840 --> 00:05:10.790
Estimate area of impact.

00:05:10.790 --> 00:05:12.990
It's going to be
near the frozen cliff.

00:05:13.270 --> 00:05:14.990
Do we have any
observers there ?

00:05:14.990 --> 00:05:16.940
We have two trainees.

00:05:17.480 --> 00:05:18.150
Who are they ?

00:05:17.690 --> 00:05:21.290
Earth Force Commander

00:05:18.150 --> 00:05:19.960
Kodai Susumu
and Shima Daisuke.

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:22.100
Can they handle it ?

00:05:22.100 --> 00:05:24.690
They're training
for a special mission.

00:05:24.690 --> 00:05:26.840
They're not done yet,
but I believe they can handle it.

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:28.120
Alright, contact them.

00:05:45.140 --> 00:05:46.440
Mars Observatory

00:05:50.360 --> 00:05:54.580
Order from Earth HQ.
Identify the object that crashed.

00:05:55.550 --> 00:05:57.740
That's probably
what it was.

00:05:57.740 --> 00:06:01.740
There is a battle near Pluto, right ?
Could it be one of them ?

00:06:01.740 --> 00:06:02.740
Catch.

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:06.350
But Pluto is
too far away.

00:06:24.120 --> 00:06:25.440
Hey Shima, that's it.

00:06:26.050 --> 00:06:28.940
Looks like a spacecraft.
It's not from Gamilus or Earth.

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:35.200
I'm landing.

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:35.950
Be careful.

00:07:05.290 --> 00:07:06.290
Hey, Shima.

00:07:20.950 --> 00:07:22.070
She's dead.

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:26.910
What's that ?
A message capsule ?

00:07:56.590 --> 00:07:57.720
Close the
partition shield !

00:07:58.120 --> 00:07:59.330
Engine malfunctioning !

00:07:59.330 --> 00:08:00.330
Wait !

00:08:08.410 --> 00:08:12.090
Distance 8500. Velocity gain +2.
It's on course.

00:08:12.090 --> 00:08:13.410
Launch missiles !

00:08:25.150 --> 00:08:28.870
This is missile ship 17.
Just sunk one assault ship.

00:08:28.870 --> 00:08:32.990
Repeat, this is missile ship 17,
Captain Kodai Mamoru...

00:08:33.690 --> 00:08:35.940
That's Okita's ship.
It's heavily damaged.

00:08:42.140 --> 00:08:43.100
Captain ?!

00:08:43.100 --> 00:08:44.540
I'm alright.

00:08:45.610 --> 00:08:47.510
Our laser ship exploded.

00:08:47.510 --> 00:08:50.000
How many of
our fleet are left ?

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:53.170
This ship and
one missile ship.

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:54.480
Whose ship is it ?

00:08:54.480 --> 00:08:57.020
Commander of defense,
Kodai Mamoru.

00:09:02.320 --> 00:09:05.690
Alright.
It's over.

00:09:05.690 --> 00:09:06.350
We have to pull back.

00:09:07.650 --> 00:09:09.680
Captain, are we
going to run away ?

00:09:10.530 --> 00:09:12.850
At this rate, we'll
die for nothing.  Withdraw.

00:09:14.100 --> 00:09:16.570
Turn 180 degrees about.

00:09:22.170 --> 00:09:24.800
Kodai, follow me.

00:09:25.850 --> 00:09:26.940
I can't do that.

00:09:26.940 --> 00:09:30.020
If I withdraw now, I'd be too
ashamed to face the deceased.

00:09:30.020 --> 00:09:31.540
Listen, Kodai.

00:09:31.540 --> 00:09:36.600
If we're annihilated,
no one can defend Earth.

00:09:36.600 --> 00:09:39.590
Put up with the shame
of today for tomorrow.

00:09:39.590 --> 00:09:40.620
That's how a
man should be.

00:09:40.620 --> 00:09:43.140
Okita, if you're a man...

00:09:43.140 --> 00:09:47.690
...you should fight, fight and destroy
as many enemies as possible, and die.

00:09:47.690 --> 00:09:49.140
Don't you think so ?

00:09:49.140 --> 00:09:51.140
Kodai, please understand.

00:09:52.430 --> 00:09:55.540
Course change, steady.

00:09:55.540 --> 00:09:56.840
180 degree turn, complete.

00:10:01.040 --> 00:10:03.460
Captain, Kodai's ship
isn't following !

00:10:03.460 --> 00:10:04.850
It's not ?

00:10:04.850 --> 00:10:08.760
Okita, I can't run away.
Please, let me go.

00:10:08.760 --> 00:10:11.410
Good luck, and please
take care of Earth.

00:10:12.550 --> 00:10:14.090
Don't die, Kodai.

00:10:33.330 --> 00:10:34.450
Kodai...

00:10:54.670 --> 00:10:56.390
Trainees on Mars...

00:10:56.390 --> 00:10:59.830
...grab your documents, rendezvous with
the withdrawing ship, and come home.

00:10:59.830 --> 00:11:02.180
Roger, join the ship, and return.

00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:05.540
The battle at Pluto was
over three days ago.

00:11:05.540 --> 00:11:08.310
The battleship will reach
Mars orbit in 3 hours.

00:11:17.660 --> 00:11:19.900
Mars reconnaissance
craft is approaching.

00:11:19.900 --> 00:11:21.380
Open the air lock.

00:11:37.430 --> 00:11:39.700
What happened to
my brother's ship ?

00:12:15.390 --> 00:12:18.140
No, we can't stop it.

00:12:18.140 --> 00:12:21.140
We aren't capable of
stopping a meteor bomb.

00:12:21.140 --> 00:12:24.800
How could our mother
planet have turned into that ?

00:12:28.740 --> 00:12:34.520
In 2199, Earth was reaching
its final moments.

00:12:37.900 --> 00:12:39.740
A mysterious space fleet...

00:12:39.740 --> 00:12:43.740
...which started invading known
space in the early 21st century...

00:12:43.740 --> 00:12:46.250
...finally reached
our solar system...

00:12:46.250 --> 00:12:51.350
{CHIKYUU}...and they are indiscriminately
attacking earth.

00:12:52.620 --> 00:12:56.390
{CHIKYUU JIN}Humanity has built
underground cities to survive.

00:12:56.390 --> 00:12:59.140
{CHIKYUU JIN}Despite desperate efforts
by the Earth Defense Force...

00:12:59.140 --> 00:13:02.510
{CHIKYUU JIN}...the mysterious fleet
was just too powerful.

00:13:02.510 --> 00:13:08.330
{CHIKYUU JIN}They demanded that humanity
either become slaves or die.

00:13:09.250 --> 00:13:12.740
{SHIDAI}The Earth Defense Force
slowly lost its power to resist...

00:13:12.740 --> 00:13:16.430
{SHIDAI}...and the Earth Defense Fleet
was Earth's last remaining hope.

00:13:16.430 --> 00:13:22.380
{KYODAI}But now, it has nearly been destroyed by
the mysterious fleet's powerful attack.

00:13:24.540 --> 00:13:31.590
{YUUSEI}The meteor bombs contaminated not
only the surface, but also underground.

00:13:32.550 --> 00:13:35.990
{MOHAYA} There is no longer any habitable
land on the Earth's surface.

00:13:35.990 --> 00:13:39.540
Must people only
wait for death ?

00:13:39.540 --> 00:13:41.430
{ASU}Is there any
hope for tomorrow ?

00:13:44.040 --> 00:13:48.150
You'll see, demons.
As long as I live, I'll fight.

00:13:48.150 --> 00:13:53.640
I won't give in to despair.  I won't
give up, even if I'm the last survivor.

00:14:22.820 --> 00:14:25.490
This dock was full of
water a long time ago.

00:14:43.890 --> 00:14:47.250
Radioactive contamination is
reaching 1 km underground.

00:14:47.250 --> 00:14:50.920
At this rate, humanity will
be extinct within a year.

00:14:56.740 --> 00:14:58.490
Kodai, what's wrong ?

00:14:59.200 --> 00:15:00.970
Is it about
your brother ?

00:15:18.870 --> 00:15:22.400
Captain, what happened
to my brother's ship ?

00:15:25.550 --> 00:15:26.570
You are...?

00:15:26.570 --> 00:15:28.220
Kodai Mamoru's
younger brother.

00:15:28.800 --> 00:15:30.480
Kodai's...?

00:15:31.470 --> 00:15:33.610
I see.

00:15:33.610 --> 00:15:36.140
Kodai was a man...

00:15:36.140 --> 00:15:37.950
...a brave man.

00:15:37.950 --> 00:15:41.020
But he won't return.
Please, forgive me.

00:15:41.810 --> 00:15:43.600
My brother...?

00:15:43.600 --> 00:15:45.790
I won't let his
death be in vain.

00:15:48.740 --> 00:15:52.030
Why didn't you bring
him home, Captain ?

00:15:53.200 --> 00:15:54.540
I'm sorry.

00:16:04.470 --> 00:16:08.080
Kodai, someday we'll go to
space and avenge your brother.

00:16:14.180 --> 00:16:18.990
The Captain was wounded.
I bet he went to the hospital at HQ.

00:16:18.990 --> 00:16:21.700
My brother died. He wasn't
just wounded, he died.

00:16:41.090 --> 00:16:44.520
So this is the
message capsule.

00:16:44.520 --> 00:16:48.430
Well done.  Both of you have 
completed your training{are full fledged}. Get some rest.

00:16:48.430 --> 00:16:49.430
Yes, sir.

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:12.700
She looks just like her.

00:17:14.020 --> 00:17:16.620
Wha...? This is the
hospital section of HQ.

00:17:21.140 --> 00:17:25.710
I'll do the operation,
don't you get it ?

00:17:25.710 --> 00:17:28.410
What's the name of the
nurse who just walked by ?

00:17:28.410 --> 00:17:29.740
W...wh...what ?!

00:17:29.740 --> 00:17:32.540
She's Mori Yuki, the
beauty of the hospital.

00:17:32.540 --> 00:17:35.440
You've got good eyes.

00:17:35.440 --> 00:17:36.470
Ouch...

00:17:37.900 --> 00:17:39.640
Damn you...

00:17:46.050 --> 00:17:47.860
What are you ?

00:17:47.860 --> 00:17:51.140
I'm a genius.
I'm useful in anything.

00:17:52.140 --> 00:17:53.460
Who was that man ?

00:17:53.460 --> 00:17:59.460
He is a great vet, Sado Sakezo.
You'll see his ability soon.

00:18:06.370 --> 00:18:07.760
I screwed up.

00:18:07.760 --> 00:18:11.490
That was the fifth today.

00:18:13.490 --> 00:18:14.140
What's wrong ?

00:18:14.140 --> 00:18:15.700
No, nothing.

00:18:20.780 --> 00:18:22.550
Hello, this is Okita.

00:18:22.550 --> 00:18:25.030
What ?  From Earth
Command Headquarters ?

00:18:42.470 --> 00:18:44.690
What's wrong with him ?
He looks depressed.

00:18:44.690 --> 00:18:46.970
Does he need a vitamin
drink or something ?

00:18:46.970 --> 00:18:49.140
No, that won't do it.

00:18:49.140 --> 00:18:51.610
His only brother died
in the battle near Pluto.

00:18:52.810 --> 00:18:53.930
I see.

00:18:53.930 --> 00:18:58.160
I can understand a man's
feelings, but women can't.

00:18:58.160 --> 00:19:00.650
Yeah, right.
Be that way then.

00:19:00.650 --> 00:19:02.080
You dummy.
It was going perfectly.

00:19:02.080 --> 00:19:05.280
Take it easy.
I have news for you.

00:19:05.280 --> 00:19:09.640
The analysis of the message capsule
you brought back from Mars is finished.

00:19:23.350 --> 00:19:26.610
I am Starsha of Iscandar.

00:19:27.780 --> 00:19:32.140
If my sister Sarsha
arrives at Earth safely...

00:19:32.140 --> 00:19:37.610
...and if you receive my message,
you should come to Iscandar.

00:19:37.610 --> 00:19:44.140
All life on Earth will become extinct in
one year due to radioactive poisoning...

00:19:44.140 --> 00:19:46.670
...so you have
no time to waste.

00:19:46.670 --> 00:19:53.490
We have the Cosmo Cleaner-D,
which will eliminate the radioactivity.

00:19:53.490 --> 00:19:59.620
Unfortunately, I can't
send it to Earth myself.

00:19:59.620 --> 00:20:04.490
I'm 148,000 light years
from the galactic system.

00:20:05.470 --> 00:20:10.900
I believe you will
come to Iscandar.

00:20:10.900 --> 00:20:14.340
I'm Starsha of Iscandar.

00:20:19.000 --> 00:20:21.110
Okita, what do
you think it is ?

00:20:21.110 --> 00:20:23.900
Looks like
blueprints for an engine.

00:20:25.320 --> 00:20:27.760
I wonder if we can
trust her, Okita.

00:20:27.760 --> 00:20:30.120
Right now, we have
no choice but to do so.

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:33.740
But she's 148,000 light years away.
How do we get there ?

00:20:36.160 --> 00:20:37.590
Emergency alert !

00:20:37.590 --> 00:20:40.950
An unidentified scout plane is
approaching the sunken ship, Yamato !

00:20:45.550 --> 00:20:47.640
Shima, I want to go.

00:20:47.640 --> 00:20:51.940
If it's one of the bastards who killed
my brother, at least I want to see it...

00:20:51.940 --> 00:20:54.940
...to engrave this
grief into my heart.

00:20:58.090 --> 00:21:01.350
Hey, wait !  You guys
will be an easy target !

00:21:03.920 --> 00:21:04.760
Here we go.

00:21:04.760 --> 00:21:05.670
Alright.

00:21:21.620 --> 00:21:25.090
But I wonder what it's
doing in Kyushu.

00:21:25.090 --> 00:21:29.130
The Yamato is just scrap metal,
sunk in a war a long time ago.

00:21:29.130 --> 00:21:30.190
Strange.

00:21:36.030 --> 00:21:38.520
Hey, we're
almost over Kyushu.

00:21:40.640 --> 00:21:41.970
Radar has detected something.

00:21:51.950 --> 00:21:53.980
There it is.
I'll shoot it down.

00:21:57.610 --> 00:21:58.890
Go after it !

00:22:05.190 --> 00:22:07.300
No, the engine
is overheating.

00:22:07.300 --> 00:22:08.930
Damn this piece of crap !

00:22:20.690 --> 00:22:22.410
Hey Shima,
are you alright ?

00:22:22.410 --> 00:22:24.990
You worry about yourself.

00:22:25.800 --> 00:22:29.680
We were so close.  I wanted to shoot
it down, even if it was only one.

00:22:31.300 --> 00:22:33.000
We'll be punished
when we return.

00:22:33.000 --> 00:22:36.090
I wonder why an enemy
scout plane has come here.

00:22:40.530 --> 00:22:41.810
What's wrong ?

00:22:52.200 --> 00:22:54.160
Shima, is that the Yamato ?

00:22:54.160 --> 00:22:57.140
It really is
just scrap metal.

00:22:57.140 --> 00:22:59.600
What was that enemy
scout plane searching for ?

00:22:59.600 --> 00:23:01.460
What's the secret behind it ?

00:23:15.350 --> 00:23:19.370
The Yamato sits silently,
like a tomb before the setting sun.

00:23:19.370 --> 00:23:24.480
However, the Yamato holds
mankind's hopes for tomorrow.

00:23:24.480 --> 00:23:28.810
When will the Yamato
show its deadly power ?

00:23:28.810 --> 00:23:32.740
Awaken from your
200 year slumber.

00:23:48.630 --> 00:23:54.300
Okita Juzo:

00:23:48.630 --> 00:23:54.300
Naya Goro

00:23:53.280 --> 00:24:01.880
A girl was waving her red scarf.{Anoko ga futteita makka na scarf}

00:23:54.590 --> 00:24:00.320
Starsha:

00:23:54.590 --> 00:24:00.320
Hirai Michiko

00:24:01.230 --> 00:24:10.730
History Notes:

00:24:01.880 --> 00:24:10.680
Who was that for ?{Dareno tame da to omotte iruka}

00:24:10.680 --> 00:24:18.980
It doesn't matter who it was for...{Dare no tame demo ii ja nai ka}

00:24:10.730 --> 00:24:20.730
History Notes:

00:24:18.980 --> 00:24:27.880
...everyone should take it as theirs.{Minna sono ki de ireba ii}

00:24:20.730 --> 00:24:26.730
Video Note:

00:24:27.260 --> 00:24:33.860
Translation

00:24:27.260 --> 00:24:33.860
Editing

00:24:27.880 --> 00:24:36.280
In the hearts of men, who are
leaving on a long journey...{Tabidattsu otoko no mune ni wa}

00:24:33.860 --> 00:24:41.430
Timing

00:24:33.860 --> 00:24:41.430
Song Translations

00:24:36.280 --> 00:24:43.880
...a piece of romance is needed.{Roman no kakera ga hoshii no sa}

00:24:41.430 --> 00:24:49.430
A

00:24:43.880 --> 00:24:47.880
La la la...

00:24:47.880 --> 00:24:51.880
La la la...

00:24:51.880 --> 00:25:01.780
La la la, red scarf.{makka na scarf}
